    <section class="bg-linear-to-b from-amber-50 to-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md border border-amber-100 leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
            <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold py-4">Privacy</h1>

            <p class="mb-4"><strong><i>Last Revised: May 24, 2015</i></strong></p>
            <p class="mb-4"><strong>Your Personal Information</strong></p>
            <p class="mb-4">When you are enrolled in an online training course, you and or your employer provide us with information that personally identifies you ('Personal Information').  SafeAndCertified.com Inc (SafeAndCertified.com) and its related third parties treat all personal information provided by you and collected by SafeAndCertified.com during the enrollment, training, and testing process in strict confidence.  Your personal information is protected by high standards of security.  SafeAndCertified.com does not knowingly collect information from children under the age of 16 (sixteen) years of age.  This web site is not directed to children. We use your Personal Information (PII) primarily to:</p>
            <p class="mb-4">Provide you with a Username and Access Code to access www.SafeAndCertified.com (web site)</p>
            <p class="mb-4">Monitor use of the website training materials and web site services for training and testing.</p>
            <p class="mb-4">Identify your training records for your employers administrator to update your employee records, including access logs and test results.</p>
            <p class="mb-4">Contact you regarding your use of the web site and services.</p>					
            <p class="mb-4"><strong>Passwords</strong></p>
            <p class="mb-4">In order to authenticate your session accessing the web site an individual Username and Password is provided to you to gain access to certain services or sections in this site. You are solely responsible for the control and use of each password and the use of this password is governed by the Terms of Use and your use of the Username and Password are an express indication of the Terms of Use Agreement.</p>
            <p class="mb-4"><strong>Use of Cookies</strong></p>
            <p class="mb-4">Some of our web pages use 'cookies'. A cookie is a small file that a web site may send to your browser. This file is then stored on your hard drive. A cookie does not contain any Personal Information, but it does enable SafeAndCertified.com to build a better web site by recording how and when guests use our site and to better serve you when you return to our site. You can set your browser to refuse cookies, but if you do, you might not be able to take full advantage of our site.</p>
            <p class="mb-4"><strong>Disclosure of PII to Third Parties</strong></p>
            <p class="mb-4">SafeAndCertified.com may employ other companies and individuals to perform functions on its behalf.  These third parties may have access to SafeAndCertified.com's users PII in order to provide these services on SafeAndCertified.com's behalf.  SafeAndCertified.com works with Change Innovators Inc. to provide the materials and testing procedure on the web site.  In addition there may be other third parties SafeAndCertified.com contracts at their discretion to provide services and access user's PII.</p>
            <p class="mb-4"><strong>Corporate Change</strong></p>
            <p class="mb-4">SafeAndCertified.com may sell transfer or otherwise disclose information including PII, in connection with a corporate merger, consolidation, the sale of substantially all assets, or other fundamental corporate change.</p>
            <p class="mb-4"><strong>Security</strong></p>
            <p class="mb-4">SafeAndCertified.com stores information they collect on third party limited access servers, hosting in Canada, which we entrust to our hosting providers to secure and maintain to protect your PII from unauthorized discplosure.  Unfortunatly no data transmission over the Internet or storage on a web based server can me guaranteed to be 100% secure.  SafeAndCertified.com cannot ensure or warrant the security of information you transmit through the web site and you do so at your own risk.</p>
            <p class="mb-4"><strong>Contacting SafeAndCertified.com</strong></p>
            <p class="mb-4">Please feel free to contact SafeAndCertified.com either by emailing us at info@SafeAndCertified.com, Attn: Allan Dubyts, Privacy Officer or by calling 1-877-425-5820 if: </p>
				
            <ul class="m-10 list-disc">
                <li>You have concerns or comments about SafeAndCertified.com's Privacy Policy and related practices. </li>
                <li>You would like to stop receiving information from SafeAndCertified.com. </li>
                <li>You want to correct or update your Personal Information. </li>
            </ul>
